  (text "ESP32 DevKit mapping (typical 30-pin):\n- GPIO21/22 OLED I2C\n- GPIO16/17 Serial2 GM67\n- GPIO34 VBAT_SENSE\n- GPIO32/33/25 buttons\n- VIN = +5V from boost\n- 3V3 = OLED only\n\nAssign footprints in CvPcb:\nJ1/J2 PinHeader 1x15\nJ3/J4 PinHeader 1x4 or JST-XH\nJ5 JST-PH 2pin\nR 0805, C 0805\nSW 6x6 tactile" (at 25.4 160 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1de7884e-fc3d-4693-9548-b802c66b6bd2"))

